@*
    The block that says where Verichat is and how to reach it, rendered from
    VerichatContact so that the address, the two phone numbers and the sales address
    exist once in this application. Four public pages need it, and a phone number that
    is right on one of them and stale on the others is worse than printing no number.
*@
<div class="lnd-doc__contact">
    <p>@VerichatContact.Company</p>
    <p>@VerichatContact.Street, @VerichatContact.Suburb, @VerichatContact.City, @VerichatContact.Country</p>
    <p>
        <a href="@VerichatContact.PhoneHref">@VerichatContact.Phone</a>
        &middot;
        <a href="@VerichatContact.PhoneAlternateHref">@VerichatContact.PhoneAlternate</a>
    </p>
    <p><a href="@VerichatContact.EmailHref">@VerichatContact.Email</a></p>
</div>
